Package: vsk
Version: 0.3.0
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: VSK Project <vsk-project@example.invalid>
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.35)
Description: VSK programming language runtime
 VSK is an independent, case-insensitive scripting language.
 The package installs the vsk command and supports: vsk program.vk
